From: Sebastien Merle <s.merle@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:27:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add crate isolation and static NIF bundling

Independent NIF crates sharing one Rustler instance also share its
registration inventories. Named initialization symbols alone do not
isolate their functions and resources.

Add opt-in crate isolation and helper ownership records, preserving
default behavior. Add rustler-bundler to generate a single staticlib
from ordinary NIF crates and report its named initialization entries
for integration with static NIF loaders.

Document the linking requirements and add unit and CLI coverage.

---

